# Paths pqinv skips when scanning its own tree. These files are the
# tool's knowledge: the rules, the regex patterns, the XML algorithm URI
# table and the x509 signature-hash table name every algorithm the tool
# detects, and the test tables do the same. A regex scanner cannot tell
# a definition from a use, so this file is how a repo tells it. Same
# syntax works in any repo you scan: one Go path.Match glob per line;
# no slash = match the base name anywhere; trailing slash = directories
# only.
rules/rules.yaml
internal/probe/repo/patterns.yaml
internal/probe/saml/saml.go
internal/probe/certs/certs.go
*_test.go
